26:19Z","value":36,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4852340","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1846651706689970","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"announcement","title":"Keikaku Next Fest Live","summary":"Welcome to Keikaku Next Fest Broadcast!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:20:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689970","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1846651706682703","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update V1.18 | Next Fest","summary":"Hi everyone!Bigger Update this time. This update focuses on wheel support and force feedback system, this is still early access to the FFB since i am not quite happy with the current suspension and tire model.This will be improved later! Changelog:-Added Controller support and Force Feedback. *EXPERIMENTAL*-Added 2 new wheelsets for Free demo-Added New Bodykit for Free demo-Added Day-Night Cycle to Free demo-Added new tire smoke and skid marks-Fixed some shader errors-Fixed Sideskirt AO-Fixed mi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T18:21:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682703","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1842846814453350","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Patch V1.16","summary":"Changelog:-Reworked Mirrors completely to be more performant.-Reworked Save system Caching. (this hopefully fixed save corruptions). Saving time improved by 5-10x, Loading time will be improved later too.-Reworked Menus completely. (added language, resolution and v-sync selection and fixed superwide resolutions)-Added side mirrors-Fixed Target FPS setting-Performance changes to the VHS filter. (caused high GPU temps before)-LTStudio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T15:06:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453350","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1842846814449090","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix v1.152","summary":"Changelog:-Fixed tool in hand bugs.-Tweaked some car materials.-Added Names to Car Parts and Items.-LTStudio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T13:39:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449090","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1842846814440659","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Patch V1.15","summary":"Hi! Optimization, Bug fixes and Some improvements this time.Changelog: -Fixed 99% of the part clipping through the ground problems!! -Fixed flywheel trigger bug. (this caused the flywheel fail when loading the game sometimes). -Fixed lights rotation bug. -Fixed money numbers overflowing UI element. -Optimized big chunk of textures and materials. -Optimized car models. (added lods) -Improved Blinkers -Improved Headlights -Improved Cabin Lights -Improved Some car materials. -Improved player light ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T15:13:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440659","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1841579228678121","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Patch V1.14","summary":"Tiny fixes this time!Changelog:| Free Demo |-Adjusted player light to have more visibility in dark places.-Removed FPS counter (you can use steam built-in one)-Fixed Mismatched physics layers on item reset. (this caused clipped items to not reset in front of garage...)| Supporter Edition |-Fixed driveshaft dismantling bug when using the aftermarket Differential.-LTStudio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T12:02:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678121","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1841579228671486","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Update V1.13","summary":"Changelog:-Fixed controls PLAYER/CAR mode select bug.-Fixed a bug when trying to interact with car interior from outside the car.-Fixed a bug where the player sometimes \"entered\" the car from under it, this resulted in the player getting stuck under the car.-Fixed inconsistent randomization on storage spawner. (previously the first spawn had always more stuff)-Fixed parts garage slogan!-Added vending machine with actual functionality.-Added basic drinks.-Added player light to help visibility in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T14:13:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671486","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1840944183782106","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Update V1.12","summary":"Hi!New update focuses on car handling, Quality of life improvements and Language support!I have also made some pretty visible upgrades on the carpaint and wheel materials!Changelog:-Added better error fallback for carpart saving. Now if the savesystem fails it does not result in a broken save. The part that fails just gets uninstalled from the car.-Added language support for: JP, ES, PL, DE-Added Push Mode!-Added automatic crouch when entering the car!-Improved materials for all custom wheels an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T13:28:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183782106","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1840310314351263","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix v1.111","summary":"Changelog: -Fixed suspension saving bug that was caused by the latest patch. -LTStudio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T11:09:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314351263","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1840310314349596","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Update V1.11","summary":"This update focuses mainly on the car handling and global lighting. Both of these changes are made for the soon upcoming Patreon release! Changelog: -Fixed settings save sometimes not working. -Fixed store cash register double clicking. (previously would take double the money if double-clicked). -Reworked lighting to support day-night cycle! -Adjusted drive mode sway for oem seat to be more realistic. -Big changes to handling of the car. Stock suspension is now more like stock suspension and cen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T17:22:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314349596","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1839676055897063","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Patch V1.10","summary":"Changelog:-Fixed connector layer when in hand. Does not collide with anything anymore.-Fixed a bug where the car could be driven inside a storage. This would cause lot of errors since parts from the car was deleted when the storage closed.-Fixed glitching doors and hood when hit with a part in hand.-Engine cant run outside enginebay anymore.-Increased interaction raycast lenght from 1 > 1.1m to close the door while seated.-Added auto-clutch system.-Disabled input on loading screen.-Changed stock","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T10:33:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055897063","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1839676055892385","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Patch V1.09","summary":"Hi! A bit bigger patch this time! Changelog: -Fixed wires resetting state on uninstall. -Fixed wheels in store, previously were grabbable. -Fixed Wheels bug where they could be installed on top of each other. -Fixed colliders on wall objects by the gas station. -Fixed ejected cassette sometimes playing songs. -Fixed tachometer needles reset when turning off ignition. -Fixed \"stretched\" wires visual bug when exiting drive mode. -Fixed mouse sensitivity resetting. -Fixed connectors in hand collisi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T10:20:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892385","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1839676055889439","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Patch V1.08","summary":"Changelog: -Fixed timer finished state resetting when exiting pause menu. -Fixed plug and oil filter tool interaction input. (it was reversed before). -Improved bounciness on parts in hand. -Improved collisions, player cannot fly anymore holding a part. -Items in hand dont collide with other items anymore. -Changed mass values for some objects. -Added basic helper board for new players. -Engine can now be picked up from the sides.(experimental) -LTStudio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T21:53:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055889439","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1839676055885062","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix V1.072","summary":"Finally found a solution for Input lag, at least in testing it now works properly!Changelog:-Fixed input lag that was caused when controller was connected to the computer.-Raised lift so its easier to stand under the car (also helps with the car flying off the lift)-LTStudio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T12:25:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055885062","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1839676055883674","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix V1.071","summary":"HOTFIX V1.071 Emergency fix to the new cassette missing songs and causing null reference error. Changelog: -Added songs to new cassette... -Fixed timer pausing when game is paused.-LTStudio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T22:32:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055883674","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1839676055883443","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"UPDATE V1.07","summary":"Hi!We are really close to hitting 10000 wishlists! Thank you all so much again! Heres an update for you, small one but i would still call it an update. Changelog: -Added new cassette!-Added Speedrun timer. Will stop once the engine reaches 6000 rpm. (Only works when starting a new game, to prevent cheating).-Added mystery envelope. -Fixed the pricing bug when selling items. -Fixed inputs when controller is connected. ( let me know if there is still a problem with this!) -Fixed throttle and brake","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T19:54:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055883443","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1839041357034451","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix V1.061","summary":"Hi! Recent update made the sensitivity work properly and people who had saved the game within old update had it saved to 0. This has now been fixed. -LTStudio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T22:14:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357034451","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1839041357034407","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Patch V1.06","summary":"Hi!Another day, another patch. We are almost at 7000 wishlists currently and im so thankful to anyone playing the game!Changelog:-Fixed money collision.-Fixed Custom bumber and sideskirt bolts not working.-Fixed terrain collision layer where sometimes items didnt reset after clipping.-Fixed Sensitivity setting.-Added Crouch and Clutch controls at settings.-Reduced Yonku spawn rate to 2.5%-Second attempt on fixing cassetteplayer bug (please let me know in discord if you have any troubles with it)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T21:28:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357034407","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1839041357032145","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Patch V1.05","summary":"Patch V1.05 is here. Changelog: -Fixed \"items\" savefile. before this all furniture etc was not saved.-Fixed stairs in drift track.-Fixed colliders on steering wheels. (unbolting them was impossible before)-Fixed Driver seat bolts getting stuck.-Added \"Are you sure\" tab, when exiting without saving!-Attempt on fixing the radio causing the interacting bug. (Couldn`t reproduce so cannot be 100% certain what was causing it but there was one likely cause which is now fixed) Huge thanks to everyone pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-25T15:31:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357032145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2440350-1839041357029862","game_id":"steam-2440350","kind":"update","title":"Patch V1.04","summary":"First of all thank you to everyone, we have now crossed the milestone of 3000 wishlists. This is quite overwhelming to me, i wasnt expecting anything like this!Now its my turn to give something to you so here we go!-Fixed terrain bug in the racetrack area.-Fixed \"forest_ground\" material normal map.-Reduced engine doppler effect.-Increased distance for part install by 25% to make